{"slug":"m-th-l","ar":"م ث ل","total":169,"core":"likeness; example","forms":[{"ar":"مَثَل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":88,"gloss":"example, parable","word":null,"ex":{"s":56,"a":23,"p":1,"ar":["كَأَمْثَـٰلِ","ٱللُّؤْلُؤِ","ٱلْمَكْنُونِ"],"en":"The likenesses of pearls well-protected"}},{"ar":"مِثْل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":75,"gloss":"like, likeness","word":null,"ex":{"s":37,"a":61,"p":1,"ar":["لِمِثْلِ","هَـٰذَا","فَلْيَعْمَلِ","ٱلْعَـٰمِلُونَ"],"en":"For the like of this let the workers [on earth] work"}},{"ar":"تَّمَاثِيل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":2,"gloss":"statues, images","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":52,"p":7,"ar":["إِذْ","قَالَ","لِأَبِيهِ","وَقَوْمِهِۦ","مَا","هَـٰذِهِ","ٱلتَّمَاثِيلُ","ٱلَّتِىٓ","أَنتُمْ","لَهَا","عَـٰكِفُونَ"],"en":"When he said to his father and his people, \"What are these statues to which you are devoted"}},{"ar":"أَمْثَل","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"best, most exemplary","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":104,"p":7,"ar":["نَّحْنُ","أَعْلَمُ","بِمَا","يَقُولُونَ","إِذْ","يَقُولُ","أَمْثَلُهُمْ","طَرِيقَةً","إِن","لَّبِثْتُمْ","إِلَّا","يَوْمًا"],"en":"We are most knowing of what they say when the best of them in manner will say, \"You remained not but one day"}},{"ar":"مَثُلَٰت","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"exemplary punishments","word":null,"ex":{"s":13,"a":6,"p":9,"ar":["وَيَسْتَعْجِلُونَكَ","بِٱلسَّيِّئَةِ","قَبْلَ","ٱلْحَسَنَةِ","وَقَدْ","خَلَتْ","مِن","قَبْلِهِمُ","ٱلْمَثُلَـٰتُ ۗ","وَإِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","لَذُو","مَغْفِرَةٍ","لِّلنَّاسِ","عَلَىٰ","ظُلْمِهِمْ ۖ","وَإِنَّ","رَبَّكَ","لَشَدِيدُ","ٱلْعِقَابِ"],"en":"They impatiently urge you to bring about evil before good, while there has already occurred before them similar punishments [to what they demand]. And indeed, your Lord is full of forgiveness for the people despite their wrongdoing, and indeed, your Lord is severe in penalty"}},{"ar":"مُثْلَىٰ","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"exemplary, best","word":null,"e